OL,3,AUkrainians dying because US restricting
OL,4,Aintelligence sharing, Zelensky adviser
OL,5,Atells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainians have died because Kyiv is
OL,8,Fstill not receiving reliable US
OL,9,Fwarnings of incoming Russian attacks,
OL,10,Faccording to a key adviser to President
OL,11,FVolodymyr Zelensky.
OL,13,FSerhii "Flash" Beskrestnov told the BBC
OL,14,Fthat lives had been lost because there
OL,15,Fhad not been time to warn citizens
OL,16,Fabout ballistic missile strikes,
OL,17,Fsaying: "It's dangerous... I think it's
OL,18,Freally very bad... People [have]
OL,19,Falready died."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
